      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2002 the Bowmanstown Borough Authority launched a water system upgrade, adding a new chlorine building and a 250,000‑gallon standpipe.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
